<%# The one way a caregiver who finds Remindly useful can pass it on, at the
    moment it has just been useful. Tagged so Admin -> Traffic shows what it
    brings; the tag says which line was used, never who forwarded it. %>
<p style="margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
  Know someone caring for a parent? Remindly is free; send them
  <a href="<%= ApplicationHelper::CANONICAL_HOST %>/?from=referral" style="color: #2563eb;"><%= ApplicationHelper::CANONICAL_HOST.delete_prefix("https://") %></a>.
</p>
